Partiduo administration manages the life cycle of a fleet of Partiduo
instances (aloli-crystal/partiduo-admin): firms, administration users,
payers, inventory of instances and of the package serving each one,
servers, task queue, backups (optionally encrypted), supervision, alerts
and an append-only audit journal. It never reads the accounting data of
the instances.

This package installs the web application (partiduo-admin), its command
line (partiduo-admin-manage), the rc.d script partiduo_admin and a cron
job running the scheduler every fifteen minutes. The executor installed on
each hosting server is packaged separately (partiduo-agent).
